{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は似顔絵会&録音会がありました！\n来て下さった皆さん\nありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会ではあまり出ないのですが、\n今日みたいなイベントは人見知りが発動\nしてしまいます。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや〜、録音会での\nファンの方が考えてきてくれる言葉には\n本当に関心してしまいます。\nそれぞれのメンバーのことを凄い理解\nしている？というか、考えているんだなぁと。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人の笑顔は究極の癒しですな^ ^\nとっても楽しかった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2015/02/11/4887784/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2015/02/11/4887784/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2015/02/11/4887784/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2015/02/11/4887784/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2015/02/11/4887784/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2015/02/11/4887784/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2015/02/11/4887784/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく握手会などで聞かれること"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「玲香の好きな食べ物なに？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A. チョコレートと肉！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分、よく考えたら他にもっと好きなモノがありそうな気もするけれど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この２つは毎日必ず食べてると思ったので、この２つを挙げておきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"因みに私は断然ミルクチョコレート派！\nビターは苦いからあまり食べません。。ホワイトチョコレートはその時の気分で食べてみたり、食べなかったりです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肉に関しては...\nよくこの説明を万理華にすると、\n言っている意味がさっぱりわからないと\n言われちゃうのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「焼肉」じゃなくて\n「焼いた肉」が好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......この微妙なニュアンス。\n文章書きながら自分でも\n違いあるの？と若干思うけれど。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「焼肉」じゃなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「焼かれた肉」みたいな、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「焼いてみた肉」みたいな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ことばっておもしろーい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ言いたいだけ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2015/02/11/4887784/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃から何かとよくしちゃう表情"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやだわぁ(´Д` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この顔を見るたびに\nあー桜井玲香だ。と実感する表情"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye.>(´ｍ｀)"}],"source":"archive"}